<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Dec industrial output down 13.1 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Dec industrial output down 13.1 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia's Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>SLOVENIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT    Dec	Nov	Dec 95</p>
<p>Mth/mth change (percent)     -13.1     -0.6     -16.5 Yr/yr</p>
<p>change (percent)		   7.9	3.6	-5.6 Index</p>
<p>(base 1995)			 96.2    110.7	90.9</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-</p>
</text>
